'=====================================================================
' Agent name : BulkReg\13 - Recover Users
' Version    : 4.6.0  (BulkReg release; libraries BulkRegCommon + BulkRegAgents + BulkRegRecover 4.6.0)
' Code       : ALL logic is in the script library BulkRegRecover (BR_RunRecover).
'              This agent only calls it, so it never changes between releases.
'
' HOW TO INSTALL: first create the library BulkRegRecover (BulkRegRecover.lss). Then open this agent,
'              click in the editor, Ctrl+A, Delete, paste this WHOLE file, Ctrl+S.
' Designer   : Shared agent, LotusScript
'              Runtime: On event > Action menu selection, Target: None
'              (NOT 'All selected documents' - Designer's default - or Notes asks for a selected document)
'              (backslash in the name = Actions > BulkReg submenu; do NOT use '|')
'
' What it does (details: BulkRegRecover.lss header and SOP-recover-failed-users.md):
'
' Checks every user against the Domino Directory (single source of truth) and the mail-file lists of the servers,
' writes RECOVER_<run>_plan.csv, and (DryRun=0, type RECOVER) in one run: removes unregistered full duplicates,
' creates missing mail files, replaces cut-off empty files, closes stale batch files that hide users from 02, verifies
' and requests the cluster replicas. Then 02 + 03 register what is left. Safe to run again at any time.
'=====================================================================
'#####################################################################
' --- part 1: (Options) ---
'#####################################################################
Option Public
Option Declare
Use "BulkRegRecover"
'#####################################################################
' --- part 2: Initialize ---
'#####################################################################
Sub Initialize
	Call BR_RunRecover()
End Sub
